<title>USA: Egypt seeks 100,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 100,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt was seeking a total of 100,000 tonnes of U.S. No. 2 or better hard red winter wheat for August to October delivery in a private tender, several U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>&quot;They tendered last night for this (amount),&quot; one U.S. exporter said. &quot;It is a private sale.&quot;</p>
<p>Egypt is seeking 15,000 tonnes wheat for August 5-20 shipment, 35,000 tonnes for September 5-20 and 50,000 tonnes for October 5-20 shipment, sources said.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
